/*
 * Template method instantiation and declaration.
 *
 * TemplateMethodDeclaration handles the instantiation of method symbols
 * produced by template specialization. After template solving produces a
 * TemplateMapper, this module:
 *
 *   - rewrites the method declaration using the mapper,
 *   - declares the resulting method symbol in the symbol tree,
 *   - validates the method against its owning class,
 *   - registers the instantiated symbol in the template instantiation cache,
 *   - replaces failed instantiations with ErrorSymbol.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::declare::method
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/declare/method.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-14
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
